{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28347","headline":"洛阳长句二首 一 · 杜牧","name":"洛阳长句二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草色人心相与闲，是非名利有无间。\n桥横落照虹堪画，树锁千门鸟自还。\n芝盖不来云杳杳，仙舟何处水潺潺？\n君王谦让泥金事，苍翠空高万岁山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}